---
title: "createUser (Legion: API Integration Flow)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_receive: POST /v1/integration/user
    q_receive --> q_validate: parse request body
    q_validate --> q_check_exists: validate user params
    q_check_exists --> q_error: user already exists
    q_check_exists --> q_create: user does not exist
    q_error --> [*]: return error response
    q_create --> q_store: create user account
    q_store --> [*]: return user credentials

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: user params must be present and valid
        INV-002: duplicate users must be rejected
    end note
